QuestGuidance.Register("en",423,{
[13505]="7002453F\n1\tDeliver the ruffled feathers to Birgir Listmaker at Othrikar\030Collect ruffled feathers (total: 10)\tYou are on a task to deliver ruffled feathers from the hendrevail in the North Downs to Birgir Listmaker at Othrikar. Othrikar is north of Esteldín in the North Downs.\n",
[13506]="70024838\n1\tCollect sleek fur and drop them in a collection box (total: 10)\tCollection boxes for this task can be found at the camps within the Misty Mountains. You should bring the trophies you gathered to a collection box.\n",
[13507]="7002482D\n1\tCollect sleek skin and drop them in a collection box (total: 10)\tCollection boxes for this task can be found at the camps within the Misty Mountains. You should bring the trophies you gathered to a collection box.\n",
[13508]="70024430\n1\tDeliver the squishy goo to Dorri at Gondamon\030Collect squishy goo (total: 10)\tYou have accepted a task to acquire squishy goo. You are to deliver them to Dorri at the western gate of Gondamon to earn favour with Thorin's Hall.\n",
[13509]="70024834\n1\tCollect studded sword sheaths and drop them in a collection box (total: 10)\tCollection boxes for this task can be found at the camps within the Misty Mountains. You should bring the trophies you gathered to a collection box.\n",
[13510]="7002453D\n1\tDeliver the tough sword sheaths to Birgir Listmaker at Othrikar\030Collect tough sword sheaths (total: 10)\tYou are on a task to deliver tough sword sheaths from the Dourhands in the North Downs to Birgir Listmaker at Othrikar. Othrikar is north of Esteldín in the North Downs.\n",
[13511]="70024829\n1\tCollect toughened carapaces and drop them in a collection box (total: 10)\tCollection boxes for this task can be found at the camps within the Misty Mountains. You should bring the trophies you gathered to a collection box.\n",
[13512]="7000BFFE\n1\tReturn Thorkell's belongings to Thorgest\030Collect Thorkell's axe\030Collect Thorkell's helm\tThe worm caves are to the south-east of Thorgest's dwelling. Thorgest has asked you to find and return Thorkell's belongings.\n",
[13513]="7000774D\n1\tTalk to Rose Thornley at Thornley's Farm\tRose Thornley is at her home, west of Saeradan's cabin. The Ranger Saeradan suggested you speak with Rose Thornley concerning her husband's disappearance.\n2\tFind Robb Thornley\tRobb was last seen heading north along the road. Rose Thornley has asked you to find her husband.\n",
[13514]="7000774E\n1\tFree Robb Thornley and escort him to safety.\tRobb Thornley has asked you to help him escape from the Orc-camp.\n2\tTalk to Rose Thornley at Thornley's Farm\tRose Thornley can be found at their farm in the Bree-fields, south of the Orc-camp. Robb Thornley's wife, Rose, should be told of her husband's escape from the Orcs.\n",
[13515]="7000774F\n1\tDefeat the Red Reaver\tThe Red Reaver is in the Orc-stockade on the western side of the Greenway, north of Thornley's farm. On behalf of her husband, Rose Thornley has offered you a reward if you would go to the stockade and slay the Red Reaver.\n2\tTalk to Rose Thornley at Thornley's Farm\tThornley's farm is south along the Greenway from the Orc-stockade. You should return to Thornley's farm at once to tell Rose of your victory and claim your reward.\n",
[13516]="7006E4C7\n1\tDefeat Tarkrîp Orcs (total: 8)\tRangers in Bree-land are concerned over the appearance of a foe they have long fought in the north, the Tarkrîp Orcs. You should defeat them so that the Thornley family may once again be able to sleep at night.\n2\tDeliver more vengeance (total: 8)\tRangers in Bree-land are concerned over the appearance of a foe they have long fought in the north, the Tarkrîp Orcs. You have already slain many, but many yet remain. Robb Thornley could probably do with a little more vengeance.\n3\tFind the Red Reaver\tA suitable amount of vengeance has been delivered to the Tarkrîp Orcs that captured and tortured Robb Thornley. Now it is time to seek the one called the Red Reaver.\n4\tDefeat the Red Reaver\tA suitable amount of vengeance has been delivered to the Tarkrîp Orcs that captured and tortured Robb Thornley. Now it is time to face the one called the Red Reaver.\n",
[13517]="7004D08D\n1\tTalk to Sigrun\tYou should speak with Sigrun, who can be found in the Misty Mountains.\n2\tTalk to Sigrun\tYou should speak with Sigrun, who can be found in the Misty Mountains.\n",
[13518]="7007162B\n1\tUse medicinal bandage on freed thralls (total: 10)\tThe thralls in Esh Mêkag need help fighting the Ordâkhai. You should collect medicinal bandages and use them on injured thralls.\n2\tTalk to Ebuzâm\tYou have done much to aid the thralls revolting in Esh Mêkag. You should return to Ebuzâm.\n",
[13519]="70040EE3\n1\tTalk to Boradan the Beacon-warden\030Talk to Mildir\030Talk to Cenedel\tMildir and Cenedel can be found in Ost Lontir, and Boradan can be found outside Ost Lontir near the beacon, Amon Lontir. Gilanor has asked you to acquaint yourself with the people of Ost Lontir and aid them where needed.\n2\tTalk to Gilanor\tGilanor can be found in Ost Lontir in central Belfalas. You have spoken to the people of Ost Lontir and should now return to Gilanor.\n",
[13520]="70049553\n1\tBury Stout-axes slain by the Order of the Eye (total: 8)\030Defeat cultists of the Order of the Eye at Lûghash (quantity: see journal)\tSlain Stout-axes and cultists of the Order of the Eye can be found surrounding Lûghash. Dréri has asked you to bury slain Stout-axes outside Lûghash and avenge the fallen by defeating cultists of the Order of the Eye.\n2\tTalk to Dréri in Lûghash\tDréri can be found at the Stout-axe barracks within Lûghash. You have defeated many cultists of the Order of the Eye and buried the Stout-axes slain by them. You should now return to Dréri.\n",
[13521]="70033338\n1\tLook out upon the Bridge of Khazad-dûm once more\tThe east side of the shattered Bridge of Khazad-dûm can be found west of the First Hall in Nud-melek. You should stand upon the east side of the shattered bridge and look out at the chasm once more, for you feel compelled to see it again before leaving Moria.\n2\tReturn to Svanr\tSvanr is at the First Hall of Moria in eastern Nud-melek. You should return to Svanr.\n",
[13522]="70072EFE\n1\tDefeat Heirsworn Corsairs at the Haven of Bâkhridar (total: 10)\tThe Heirsworn Corsairs that follow Balakhâd grow tired of waiting at the Haven of Bâkhridar for the command to sail to war. They want to fight!\n2\tCompleted\tYou have given some of the Heirsworn what they wanted: an excuse to fight!\n",
[13523]="7006AE1A\n1\tDefeat Nêpharai gladiators (total: 15)\tSeek out the Nêpharai and weaken their numbers before they pose a greater threat to the camp.\n2\tTalk to Bâkhadir outside of Harkhaphâr\tReturn to Bâkhadir located just north of Harkhaphâr and inform him of your deeds.\n",
[13524]="7006AED0\n1\tRescue ambushed refugees (total: 5)\tSeveral ambushed refugees have been lost near Jâx Ugikh. Please aid them and return them home.\n2\tTalk to Azrât in Kên Taghlim\tAzrât is an archivist in Kên Taghlim and an aid to our cause. Seek her out and let her know about what is happening in Jâx Ugikh.\n",
[13525]="70033336\n1\tPick flowers to commemorate the fallen dwarves\tFlowers can be found growing in the sun in the Dimrill Dale, near the East Gate of Moria. You should pick fair flowers for your tribute to your fallen fellow travellers.\n2\tPick fair flowers (total: 6)\tFlowers can be found growing in the sun in the Dimrill Dale, near the East Gate of Moria. You should pick fair flowers for your tribute to you fallen fellow travellers.\n3\tPlant flowers to remember the fallen dwarves (total: 6)\tOld, unused vases can be found lining the east stairs outside of Moria, in the Dimrill Dale. You should plant the flowers you collected in the vases to commemorate the dwarves who lost their lives, never passing the east door.\n4\tCompleted\tYou have commemorated the fallen dwarves of the expedition appropriately.\n",
[13526]="70044AB5\n1\tTalk to Egwylf before the wall of Helm's Deep\tEgwylf has decided that the time has come to report the result of her errand seeking the Blood Eye cultists to Erkenbrand.\n2\tTalk to Bingo before the wall of Helm's Deep\tBingo is outside the great wall of the fortress at Helm's Deep.\n3\tTalk to Bingo at the town of Marton, in the Westfold\tBingo wants to journey to the village of Marton, north-east of Helm's Deep in the Westfold, in order to look for some food to quiet his grumbling stomach.\n4\tDefeat any enemies that threaten the Westfold (total: 12)\030Search burned debris in Marton (total: 4)\tBingo has been devastated by the evidence of the destruction of Marton, and wants you to search the ruined town for any survivors that might be trapped within the rubble. He also wants you to defeat any enemies that threaten the Westfold.\n5\tTalk to Bingo outside Marton, in the Westfold\tBingo is on the road that runs through the ruined town of Marton, in the Westfold.\n6\tBingo found a woman wandering among the ruins of Marton, in the Westfold. He asked you to tell her that you would bring her to safety in the town of Grimslade.\t\n7\tBingo is in the centre of the town of Grimslade, in the Westfold.\t\n8\tTalk to Bingo inside the Grimslade Mead Hall\tBingo wants to meet you inside the Grimslade Mead Hall, located atop the hill in the centre of Grimslade.\n",
[13527]="7005A41E\n1\tMissing scouts can be found in Gadh Ujáf, Zagâf Muzug, and Rung-shakam. You should look for, and rescue, the missing scouts.\t\n2\tReturn to Sárgo\tSárgo is in Zirakazhâr. You should return to Sárgo.\n",
[13528]="70069446\n1\tCraft a crate of woven armour for the Umbar Tailor's Guild\tThe recipe needed to complete this quest is available for purchase. Purchase the quest recipe from the guild leader. Package a crate of woven armour.\n2\tDeliver a crate of woven armour to the Umbar Tailor's Guild Leader\tProvide the crate of woven armour to the Umbar Tailor's Guild Leader.\n",
[13529]="7006B106\n1\tCraft a crate of woven armour for the Umbar Tailor's Guild\tThe recipe needed to complete this quest is available for purchase. Purchase the quest recipe from the guild leader. Package a crate of woven armour.\n2\tDeliver a crate of woven armour to the Umbar Tailor's Guild Leader\tProvide the crate of woven armour to the Umbar Tailor's Guild Leader.\n",
[13530]="700683CC\n1\tCollect strands of spider-silk ([see journal]/16)\tMake your way north into the desert and collect thick silk webs from the spiders there. Be cautious; the spiders are cunning in their nests.\n2\tCollect Spider Silk (total: 16)\tReturn the silk to Khânai at the expedition camp. She will be pleased that you helped her meet the quote placed upon her.\n",
[13531]="70025AE2\n1\tCollect scraps of ancient tapestries (total: 8)\tTham Nambarth is east of Tinnudir. You should seek scraps of ancient tapestries for the Rangers of Tinnudir.\n2\tBring the tapestry pieces to Nadfaron\tThe Rangers are at Tinnudir, west of Tham Nambarth. One of the Rangers at Tinnudir will be eager to examine the pieces of tapestry you collected.\n",
[13532]="70026192\n1\tAid Erchiel with Gauradan Relics\030Aid Erchiel with Hunting the Hunters\030Aid Remmenylf with Wards of the Gauredain\tThe Gauradan-encampment is north of the Eavespires.\n2\tTalk to Erchiel\tErchiel is at the Eavespires. Erchiel will want to know the first tasks are complete.\n",
[13533]="7000EC2C\n1\tCollect Angmarim weapons (total: 15)\tThe camps of the Angmarim are south and east of Sûri-kylä, near the Pass of Forodwaith. Pasi has asked you to help defeat the invading Angmarim.\n2\tBring the Angmarim weapons to Pasi\030Collect Angmarim weapons (total: 15)\tPasi is at Sûri-kylä, north and west of the Angmarim encampment. You should return at once to Pasi and show him the weapons of the Angmarim.\n",
[13534]="7000BFCA\n1\tDefeat Ghâshfra (total: 25)\tOrcs of the Ghâshfra can be found throughout the Rift of Nûrz Ghâshu. Hyrrokkin has asked you to defeat the Ghâshfra which have invaded the Rift of Nûrz Ghâshu.\n",
[13535]="700586F4\n1\tTalk to Derwent Bindweed outside the Bree Jail\tDerwent Bindweed is somewhere outside the Bree Jail, waiting for someone to help him with a tricky situation.\n2\tTalk to Derwent Bindweed and help him with his problem\tDerwent Bindweed is somewhere outside the Bree Jail, waiting for someone to help him with a tricky situation.\n3\tTalk to Derwent Bindweed\tDerwent Bindweed is outside the Bree Jail.\n4\tTalk to Brom Hawksbeard\tBrom Hawksbeard is in the Bree Jail.\n",
[13536]="7004CE41\n1\tDefeat Taurogrim in Tholkát (total: 15)\tTaurogrim wood-trolls can be found in Tholkát, in northern Eryn Lasgalen. You should defeat wood-trolls in Tholkát.\n2\tTalk to Thorlind\tThorlind can be found near Tholkát. You should talk to Thorlind.\n",
})
